Verify:

```text
✓ Binary starts
✓ Config loads
✓ Repository detected
✓ Git detected
✓ Inventory works
✓ Instructions discovered
✓ Skills discovered
✓ Rules discovered
✓ Task graph generated
✓ Dependency graph generated
✓ Verification engine starts
✓ State can be persisted
✓ State can be restored
```

These should be extremely fast.

