# 4. Skill/rule compliance tests

Example rule:

```text
Controllers must not contain business logic.
```

Create a fixture violating it.

Expected:

```text
Compliance: FAIL
Completion: BLOCKED
```

Then fix it:

```text
Compliance: PASS
```

This is important because **rules must become executable compliance checks**, not just prompt text.

