# 8. Expected-vs-actual change tests

This is another **critical test category**.

Expected:

```text
8 files
```

Agent changes:

```text
5 files
```

LoopGoal must say:

```text
3 expected files missing
→ NOT COMPLETE
```

Opposite:

```text
Expected: 8
Actual: 11
```

Should produce:

```text
3 unexpected files
→ RECONCILIATION REQUIRED
```

Do not automatically fail every unexpected file; some may be legitimate dependencies discovered during implementation.

The important thing is that LoopGoal **detects them and reconciles them**.

