# 15. Infinite-loop protection

Test:

```text
Agent repeatedly changes same file
→ verify
→ fails
→ changes it
→ fails
→ ...
```

LoopGoal must eventually:

```text
MAX ITERATIONS REACHED

STATUS: BLOCKED
Reason: verification did not converge
```

Never let autonomous execution run forever.

