```

for the fast checks.

Before allowing real autonomous execution:

```text
┌─────────────────────────────┐
│     LOOPGOAL PRE-FLIGHT     │
├─────────────────────────────┤
│ ✓ Inventory                 │
│ ✓ Instructions              │
