READY FOR AUTONOMOUS EXECUTION
```

### The most important test principle

Don't test only:

> **“Does LoopGoal work?”**

Test:

> **“Can LoopGoal catch itself when it is wrong?”**

Especially test **false positives**:

```text
Agent says DONE
      ↓
LoopGoal finds missing requirement
      ↓
BLOCK
```

If your test suite can reliably demonstrate that behavior across inventory, dependencies, rules, verification, evidence, and reconciliation, then your architecture is actually proving the main promise of LoopGoal rather than just testing its individual packages.
